# Optional server-side OpenRouter API key (used as a fallback if no key is sent in the request).
# Bring-your-own-key flow: users paste their OpenRouter key in the UI and it's sent per-request.
# Get a key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# NEVER prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_ — that would bundle the secret into the browser.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
